cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Few-Shot Scanner Stain Normalisation"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hoosen
    given-names: Muhammad
    affiliation: "University of the Witwatersrand"
abstract: >-
  Diffusion-based, few-shot H&E stain normalisation across whole-slide
  scanners (Aperio <-> Hamamatsu) using a frozen Stable Diffusion base
  adapted with a colour LoRA, ControlNet, and LCM-LoRA, evaluated for colour
  fidelity, structural safety, and clinical utility.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Momo3945/few-shot-scanner-stain-norm"
year: 2026
